{'symbol': 'WRB', 'date': '2021-11-03 16:15:00', 'title': 'W. R. BERKLEY CORPORATION NAMES JOHN HENLE PRESIDENT OF UNION STANDARD INSURANCE GROUP', 'text': 'GREENWICH, CONN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--W. R. BERKLEY CORPORATION (NYSE: WRB) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF JOHN HENLE AS PRESIDENT OF UNION STANDARD INSURANCE GROUP (UNION STANDARD). HE SUCCEEDS B. KEITH MITCHELL, WHO HAS BEEN NAMED CHAIRMAN OF UNION STANDARD. THE APPOINTMENTS ARE EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY. MR. HENLE JOINS UNION STANDARD WITH MORE THAN 20 YEARS OF MULTI-LINE INSURANCE EXPERIENCE, FOCUSED ON MANAGEMENT AND DISTRIBUTION. HE MOST RECENTLY SERVED AS HEAD OF DISTRICT OPERATIONS AT A LE'}